  "summary": "With over 20 years of extensive expertise in software development, project management, and solution architecture, I have consistently delivered cutting-edge enterprise solutions to a diverse clientele from the UK, Japan, Korea, and the US.\n\nMy proficiency spans a wide array of areas, encompassing Software Engineering and Development, Design Patterns, Software Architecture, Software Refactoring, Software Migration, CI/CD, Testing, Production Support, and Team Management. Additionally, I am well-versed in Cloud technologies such as AWS, Azure and GCP, leveraging their capabilities to create efficient and scalable solutions.\n\nDemonstrating adeptness in both leadership and training, I have nurtured teams at various levels, fostering their growth and success. My specialized knowledge in Java technologies, including Core, J2EE, Enterprise frameworks, and Open sources, has allowed me to craft robust and scalable solutions.\n\nMoreover, my proficiency extends to Cloudera Hadoop, HBase, Pig, Hive, Oozie, and Flume, where I have successfully designed and developed object-oriented software architectures using both Relational and NoSQL databases.\n\nMy commitment to code quality is reflected in my practice of writing clean code, supplemented by thorough unit tests and automation tests. Additionally, I thrive in a collaborative environment, engaging seamlessly with international teams and maintaining a professional work ethic.\n\nWhen it comes to troubleshooting software and environmental issues, I possess a wealth of experience, enabling me to quickly identify and resolve challenges. Furthermore, my passion for innovation drives me to swiftly adapt to new technologies, ensuring I stay at the forefront of the ever-evolving landscape of software development.",
